# turn | what happens
0 | The guard forces Kael down onto his knees on the flagstones before the mayor's dais and keeps a hand pressed on his shoulder; the hall falls quiet.
2 | The accuser holds up the near-black dagger with violet marks for the whole hall to see and names it the stolen Nightglass.
